      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Is It?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天是元宵节，你吃元宵了吗？",
      "traditional": "今天是元宵節，你吃元宵了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì yuán xiāo jié nǐ chī yuán xiāo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Today is the Lantern Festival. Have you eaten sticky rice dumplings?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "元宵节的时候，中国人喜欢吃元宵，也会说灯谜。",
      "traditional": "元宵節的時候，中國人喜歡吃元宵，也會說燈謎。",
      "pinyin": "yuán xiāo jié de shí hou zhōng guó rén xǐ huan chī yuán xiāo yě huì shuō dēng mí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "灯谜就是写在灯上的谜语，",
      "traditional": "燈謎就是寫在燈上的謎語，",
      "pinyin": "dēng mí jiù shì xiě zài dēng shang de mí yǔ",
      "english": "During the Lantern Festival, Chinese people like to eat sticky rice dumplings and tell lantern riddles."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "是几句话或几个字，意思是让人想一想它说的是什么东西。",
      "traditional": "是幾句話或幾個字，意思是讓人想一想它說的是什麼東西。",
      "pinyin": "shì jǐ jù huà huò jǐ ge zì yì si shì ràng rén xiǎng yì xiǎng tā shuō de shì shén me dōng xi",
      "english": "A lantern riddle is a riddle written on a lantern."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It is a few words or phrases meant to make people think about what it could be."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "现在，我说一个谜语，请想一想这是什么东西。",
      "traditional": "現在，我說一個謎語，請想一想這是什麼東西。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài wǒ shuō yí ge mí yǔ qǐng xiǎng yì xiǎng zhè shì shén me dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Now, I will tell a riddle. Please think about what it could be."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "这个东西有三个嘴巴，有腿但是没有手。每个人都有这个东西，你每天都能看见它。",
      "traditional": "這個東西有三個嘴巴，有腿但是沒有手。每個人都有這個東西，你每天都能看見它。",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge dōng xi yǒu sān ge zuǐ ba yǒu tuǐ dàn shì méi yǒu shǒu měi ge rén dōu yǒu zhè ge dōng xi nǐ měi tiān dōu néng kàn jiàn tā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "如果你没有它，这会是一个大问题，因为你可能就不能出门了。",
      "traditional": "如果你沒有它，這會是一個大問題，因為你可能就不能出門了。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ nǐ méi yǒu tā zhè huì shì yí ge dà wèn tí yīn wèi nǐ kě néng jiù bù néng chū mén le",
      "english": "This thing has three mouths. It has legs but no hands. Everyone has this, and you see it every day."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you don’t have it, this will be a big problem because you might not be able to go outside."
    },
